      "origin": "agent"
    },
    {
      "id": "sec-h",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 152,
      "y": 156,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 32,
      "strokeColor": "#14130f",
      "text": "How this works",
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-07-31T14:13:55.726Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-31T14:13:55.726Z",
      "version": 1,
      "rev": 2,
      "origin": "agent"
    },
    {
      "id": "sec-sub",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 152,
      "y": 198,
      "width": 940,
      "height": 34,
      "strokeColor": "#55534d",
      "text": "Everything above is produced by one loop of four steps, run once a week against a deliberately simple model.\nNo part of it is hand-tuned per city — the same thresholds run everywhere.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-07-31T14:13:55.726Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-31T14:13:55.726Z",
      "version": 1,
      "rev": 3,
      "origin": "agent"
    },
    {
      "id": "loop-card",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 152,
      "y": 260,
      "width": 1096,
      "height": 300,
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "strokeColor": "#d7d5cc",
      "role": "card",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "createdAt": "2026-07-31T14:13:55.726Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-31T14:13:55.726Z",
      "version": 1,
      "rev": 4,
      "origin": "agent"
    },
    {
      "id": "loop-h",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 170,
      "y": 278,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 26,
      "strokeColor": "#14130f",
      "text": "The loop",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-07-31T14:13:55.726Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-31T14:13:55.726Z",
      "version": 1,
      "rev": 5,
      "origin": "agent"
    },
    {
      "id": "loop-d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 170,
      "y": 312,
      "width": 940,
      "height": 20,
      "strokeColor": "#8a867d",
      "text": "One scheduled run, every week. Steps 3 and 4 only happen when step 2 says they should.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-07-31T14:13:55.726Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-31T14:13:55.726Z",
      "version": 1,
      "rev": 6,
      "origin": "agent"
    },
    {
      "id": "step-1",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 170,
      "y": 356,
      "width": 253,
      "height": 150,
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "strokeColor": "#d7d5cc",
      "label": {
        "text": "1 · Monitor\n\nScore the live champion on\nthe last 14 days of data.",
        "fontSize": 12,
        "fontFamily": 2
      },
      "role": "card",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "createdAt": "2026-07-31T14:13:55.726Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-31T14:13:55.726Z",
      "version": 1,
      "rev": 7,
      "origin": "agent"
    },
    {
      "id": "step-2",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 439,
      "y": 356,
      "width": 253,
      "height": 150,
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "strokeColor": "#d7d5cc",
      "label": {
        "text": "2 · Detect\n\nTwo independent signals:\nPSI on the features, and\nerror vs. training time.",
        "fontSize": 12,
        "fontFamily": 2
      },
      "role": "card",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "createdAt": "2026-07-31T14:13:55.726Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-31T14:13:55.726Z",
      "version": 1,
      "rev": 8,
      "origin": "agent"
    },
    {
      "id": "step-3",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 708,
      "y": 356,
      "width": 253,
      "height": 150,
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "strokeColor": "#d7d5cc",
      "label": {
        "text": "3 · Retrain\n\nIf error crossed 1.25×,\ntrain a challenger on the\nlast 45 days.",
        "fontSize": 12,
        "fontFamily": 2
      },
      "role": "card",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "createdAt": "2026-07-31T14:13:55.726Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-31T14:13:55.726Z",
      "version": 1,
      "rev": 9,
      "origin": "agent"
    },
    {
      "id": "step-4",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 977,
      "y": 356,
      "width": 253,
      "height": 150,
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "strokeColor": "#d7d5cc",
      "label": {
        "text": "4 · Promote\n\nBoth models scored on a\nheld-out week. Challenger\nwins by 5% or it's rejected.",
        "fontSize": 12,
        "fontFamily": 2
      },
      "role": "card",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "createdAt": "2026-07-31T14:13:55.726Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-31T14:13:55.726Z",
      "version": 1,
      "rev": 10,
      "origin": "agent"
    },
    {
      "id": "loop-note",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 170,
      "y": 518,
      "width": 1040,
      "height": 30,
      "strokeColor": "#8a867d",
      "text": "Why two signals: data drift needs no labels and no model, so it is the early warning. Performance drift is the action signal. Deciding\n\"has it drifted?\" by comparing champion to challenger would be circular — you'd need a challenger before being allowed to decide you need one.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-07-31T14:13:55.726Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-31T14:13:55.726Z",
      "version": 1,
      "rev": 11,
      "origin": "agent"
    },
    {
      "id": "model-card",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 152,
      "y": 576,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 340,
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "strokeColor": "#d7d5cc",
      "role": "card",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "createdAt": "2026-07-31T14:13:55.726Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-31T14:13:55.726Z",
      "version": 1,
      "rev": 12,
      "origin": "agent"
    },
    {
      "id": "model-h",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 170,
      "y": 594,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 26,
      "strokeColor": "#14130f",
      "text": "The model",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-07-31T14:13:55.727Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-31T14:13:55.727Z",
      "version": 1,
      "rev": 13,
      "origin": "agent"
    },
    {
      "id": "model-d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 170,
      "y": 628,
      "width": 504,
      "height": 48,
      "strokeColor": "#8a867d",
      "text": "Ridge regression on three weather features — deliberately boring. A simple\nmodel decays legibly when the relationship shifts; a bigger one would absorb\nsome of the drift and blur the story.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-07-31T14:13:55.727Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-31T14:13:55.727Z",
      "version": 1,
      "rev": 14,
      "origin": "agent"
    },
    {
      "id": "model-spec",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 170,
      "y": 690,
      "width": 504,
      "height": 198,
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "strokeColor": "#d7d5cc",
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "label": {
        "text": "spec table · 5 rows, label + value\nestimator · StandardScaler → Ridge(alpha=1.0)\nfeatures · temperature, wind_speed, humidity\ntarget · pm25 (µg/m³)\ntraining · chronological 80/20 tail split, then refit on the full window\nbaseline · RMSE on the held-out tail (never a random split)",
        "fontSize": 11,
        "fontFamily": 2
      },
      "role": "table",
      "createdAt": "2026-07-31T14:13:55.727Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-31T14:13:55.727Z",
      "version": 1,
      "rev": 15,
      "origin": "agent"
    },
    {
      "id": "param-card",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 708,
      "y": 576,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 340,
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "strokeColor": "#d7d5cc",
      "role": "card",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "createdAt": "2026-07-31T14:13:55.727Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-31T14:13:55.727Z",
      "version": 1,
      "rev": 16,
      "origin": "agent"
    },
    {
      "id": "param-h",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 726,
      "y": 594,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 26,
      "strokeColor": "#14130f",
      "text": "Parameters",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-07-31T14:13:55.727Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-31T14:13:55.727Z",
      "version": 1,
      "rev": 17,
      "origin": "agent"
    },
    {
      "id": "param-d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 726,
      "y": 628,
      "width": 504,
      "height": 48,
      "strokeColor": "#8a867d",
      "text": "Every threshold the loop decides with, in one place. These are the shipped\nvalues — the same ones for every city, so a city's behaviour is a property of\nits weather and not of its tuning.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-07-31T14:13:55.727Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-31T14:13:55.727Z",
      "version": 1,
      "rev": 18,
      "origin": "agent"
    },
    {
      "id": "param-spec",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 726,
      "y": 690,
      "width": 504,
      "height": 198,
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "strokeColor": "#d7d5cc",
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "label": {
        "text": "parameter table · 6 rows, name + value + what it means\nmonitor window · 14 days\nchallenger training · 45 days\nholdout · 7 days\nretrain trigger · error ÷ baseline > 1.25\nPSI significant · > 0.25  (stable <0.10, moderate 0.10–0.25)\npromotion margin · challenger must win by > 5%",
        "fontSize": 11,
        "fontFamily": 2
      },
      "role": "table",
      "createdAt": "2026-07-31T14:13:55.727Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-31T14:13:55.727Z",
      "version": 1,
      "rev": 19,
      "origin": "agent"
    },
